OL,3,GNEWSAMan who filmed 'horrific' animal
OL,4,Afight videos jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning: This story contains images and
OL,7,Fdetails which could be upsetting.
OL,9,FA man who admitted a string of animal
OL,10,Ffighting and welfare offences has been
OL,11,Fjailed for 18 months at Dumfries
OL,12,FSheriff Court.
OL,14,FRyan Cringean, of Locharbriggs,
OL,15,Fcommitted the crimes at locations
OL,16,Fincluding Dumfries, Kirkton,
OL,17,FLocharbriggs and Irongray between June
OL,18,F2024 and February 2025.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
