OL,3,GNEWSAMan who filmed 'horrific' animal
OL,4,Afight videos jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 25-year-old filmed his dogs biting
OL,7,Fand tearing apart wildlife including
OL,8,Fbadgers, squirrels and foxes. The dogs
OL,9,Falso suffered traumatic injuries with
OL,10,Fone of them having to be put down.
